        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Since Slovakia is landlocked, shipments usually clear at a port such as Koper or Hamburg and then travel overland by rail or road into Bratislava and other Slovak destinations, adding 3-5 days to the 28-33 day sea transit. Plan for 30-45 days of production ahead of that shipping window.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Do you meet Slovakia's sustainability requirements?</h3>
